# =============================================================================
# Drasi Server High Risk Containers - HTTP Requests
# =============================================================================
# Use with the VSCode REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) or similar.
# API documentation is served at http://localhost:8380/api/v1/docs/
# Run each named lookup before its paired UUID-addressed request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8380
@dashboardUrl = http://localhost:3000
@instance = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/instances/high-risk-containers-server

### ==========================================================================
### Health & Info
### ==========================================================================

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List API versions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/versions

### Exact instance/runtime identity (not by itself pipeline readiness)
GET {{instance}}/runtime

### Graph lifecycle, dependencies, waiting/failure observations
GET {{instance}}/computation

### ==========================================================================
### Sources
### ==========================================================================

### List all sources
GET {{instance}}/sources

### Resolve the PostgreSQL source
# @name devops
GET {{instance}}/components/by-name/devops

### Get the PostgreSQL (RiskyImage) source status
GET {{instance}}/sources/{{devops.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Resolve the Kubernetes source
# @name kubernetes
GET {{instance}}/components/by-name/k8s

### Get the Kubernetes source status
GET {{instance}}/sources/{{kubernetes.response.body.$.data.id}}

### ==========================================================================
### Continuous Query
### ==========================================================================

### List all queries
GET {{instance}}/queries

### Resolve the inventory query
# @name inventory
GET {{instance}}/components/by-name/pod-containers

### Shared inventory: graph-change v1 nodes labeled ContainerImage
GET {{instance}}/queries/{{inventory.response.body.$.data.id}}/results

### Resolve the risk query
# @name risk
GET {{instance}}/components/by-name/high-risk-containers

### Running high risk containers (the dashboard feed)
GET {{instance}}/queries/{{risk.response.body.$.data.id}}/results

### ==========================================================================
### Reactions
### ==========================================================================

### List all reactions
GET {{instance}}/reactions

### Resolve the dashboard reaction
# @name dashboard
GET {{instance}}/components/by-name/high-risk-containers-dashboard

### Get the dashboard reaction status
GET {{instance}}/reactions/{{dashboard.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Open the dashboard in a browser instead: {{dashboardUrl}}
### The seeded "High Risk Containers" dashboard is available via the dashboard API:
GET {{dashboardUrl}}/api/dashboards
